ds himself at a mysterious villa, watching two women bury a body. He falls into their trap and, in an atmosphere of isolation and decadence, the trio act out insane pleasure games and a ritual of blood and murder.","language":"en-US"},"tagline":{"value":"Trapped in a deadly game of torture and murder!","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"1990-12-06","status":"Released","rating":6.524,"ratingCount":85,"genres":["Commedia","Horror","Dramma"],"countries":["Greece"],"facts":{"Runtime":"112m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":17586,"name":"Meredyth Herold","role":"Daughter","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/96WSYVViDlWKyELw26sr5kywasp.jpg"},{"id":17587,"name":"Michele Valley","role":"Mother","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yVm0C5HXGvLCvOV8UqNHc6cCIRR.jpg"},{"id":17588,"name":"Panos Thanassoulis","role":"Singapore Sling","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jqG25lFfEb0t8JymY0Oi8YEjEbM.jpg"},{"id":1858181,"name":"John E. Regan","role":"Lawyer"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Singapore sling: O anthropos pou agapise ena ptoma"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Singapore Sling","overview":"Singapore Sling pursues Laura, a romantic memory from his past. One night, he finds himself at a mysterious villa, watching two women bury a body. He falls into their trap and, in an atmosphere of isolation and decadence, the trio act out insane pleasure games and a ritual of blood and murder.","tagline":"Trapped in a deadly game of torture and murder!"},{"language":"el-EL","overview":"Έρχεται από το παρελθόν και είναι σχεδόν νεκρός.\r Ο Singapore Sling είναι ένας από κείνους τους τύπους χωρίς λεφτά, σπίτι και φίλους, που κυνηγούν χαμένες υποθέσεις με γυναικεία ονόματα και μπλέκονται σε ιστορίες που δεν οδηγούν πουθενά. Η δική του ιστορία λεγόταν Λάουρα και τη συνάντησε πριν από πολλά χρόνια. Αν και υποψιάζεται πως το κορίτσι που γυρεύει τόσα χρόνια έχει πεθάνει και πως είναι ερωτευμένος μ’ ένα πτώμα, αυτός συνεχίζει να το ψάχνει.  Έτσι, ένα βράδυ με βροχή και θύελλα, πληγωμένος και χωρίς να ’χει πια να χάσει τίποτα, φτάνει σ’ ένα σπίτι, γιατί πιστεύει πως εκεί μπορεί να βρίσκεται η Λάουρα. Όμως, στον κήπο του σπιτιού, δυο γυναίκες προσπαθούν να θάψουν το πτώμα ενός άντρα -αλλά o Singaρore Sling με μια σφαίρα στον ώμο δεν μπορεί να κάνει και πολλά πράγματα.\r Περιμένει να ξημερώσει για να μπει στο σπίτι με την ελπίδα πως η Λάουρα βρίσκεται ακόμα εκεί... Όμως τα πράγματα δεν έρχονται όπως τα υπολογίζει..."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/61qTmbRikcUUnvMxcU5xv9RUUTO.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q1B2ynMiQlkRFdYe9U9g8S6GgGF.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1560,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"el-EL","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/btTYcALtXvE9j8xjvlGOnLT1cQI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/btTYcALtXvE9j8xjvlGOnLT1cQI.jpg","language":"en","width":1506,"height":2259},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/btTYcALtXvE9j8xjvlGOnLT1cQI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/btTYcALtXvE9j8xjvlGOnLT1cQI.jpg","language":"en","width":1506,"height":2259},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/61qTmbRikcUUnvMxcU5xv9RUUTO.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/61qTmbRikcUUnvMxcU5xv9RUUTO.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1431},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4wNJQIC6Zieuyp6GGZn2LPU061v.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4wNJQIC6Zieuyp6GGZn2LPU061v.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2BqTjTNayMbHMJ3QeYmtXN7aApW.jpg","previewUrl":"ht